    "description": {
      "content": "Hubilo Public APIs (branded Virtual PRO) for managing virtual, hybrid, and in-person events: events, sessions/agenda, speakers, users/attendees, member groups, exhibitor booths, organiser profile, and media upload. Derived faithfully from the provider's published Postman collection (Virtual Pro Public APIs v1.2). Rate limit: 20 requests/second at the organizer level (combined across all APIs).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hubilo Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
